        "title": "Jisu hei amuh daimei e",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Jisu hei amuh daimei e,",
            "Jaujian daimei amuh e;",
            "Sumei naumei tigai lou e,",
            "Huainei mei guai tilou e.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Ram kaguai na kaipou e,",
            "Ram kaguai ta dam lou e;",
            "Katuang nja tuang makge,",
            "Guhsu-gahsu makge.",
            "",
            "2. Aniu pangkhou guang bam lou o,",
            "Lui makmei kaibang khou hei;",
            "Ringpui ban+:1 kahi lou o,",
            "Aniu huainei bam khou hei.",
            "",
            "3. Bumang naumei tigai lou e,",
            "Lungning pumtan titan lou;",
            "Rianramei lung ti neila lou,",
            "Lunglai puimei pap kuak lou.",
            "",
            "4. Tingkau kaidai guang tang pukhou,",
            "Aniu kata hou pukhou;",
            "Kabampang hu khou lu suanni,",
            "Jisu jan ta thuan bamni."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
